{%- comment -%}
  LBASS HERO — BACKGROUND PHOTO (2026-08-01, rev3)
  Rendered by sections/lbass-hero.liquid, behind the particles and copy.

  PURPOSE: the hero was type-only, so nothing above the fold said "clothing".
  A garment photo supplies that in under a second, before a word is read.

  THE CONFLICT: the headline is ~115px of INK on a light ground. A photo behind
  it destroys the contrast that makes it readable. rev1 handled that by fading
  the WHOLE image — which protected the type but flattened the picture into
  abstract texture, so it stopped reading as clothing at all. It solved the
  legibility problem by discarding the reason the image was added.

  rev2 DECOUPLED THE TWO. The scrim is locked near-opaque at the centre where
  the type sits (0.92, independent of the setting) and "visibility" now only
  opens the OUTER stops. The headline keeps a constant contrast floor while the
  goods stay legible around it, so the default could move 22 -> 42.

  Desaturation defaults low (12%): colour is what makes a garment recognisable
  at a glance. Denim blue and sneaker tan do more work than any contrast tuning.

  rev3 — DEFAULT IMAGE. Was hero-lifestyle-3b (one pair of folded jeans plus
  roses, a lantern, sunglasses). Cropped into a wide hero it reads as a vintage
  still-life, not a clothing shop — the props outweigh the single garment.
  hero-lifestyle-1 is now the default: Jordan sneakers, Levi's denim, belt, bag
  and jewellery on Moroccan zellige. Sneakers + denim + accessories is exactly
  the category Lbass sells, and the tilework carries the Moroccan half of the
  brand without a word of copy.
  If you swap this, judge the WIDE crop — a picture that works as a square
  thumbnail can lose its subject entirely at 1280x880.

  PERF: eager + fetchpriority=high — this is the LCP element. Explicit
  width/height prevent layout shift. Shopify-uploaded images get a srcset;
  the presets are already hand-optimised webp (107-222KB).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign v = section.settings.bg_visibility | default: 42
  assign a0 = 92
  assign a1 = v | times: 45 | divided_by: 100
  assign a1 = 90 | minus: a1 | at_least: 0
  assign a2 = v | times: 105 | divided_by: 100
  assign a2 = 78 | minus: a2 | at_least: 0
  assign a3 = v | times: 105 | divided_by: 100
  assign a3 = 62 | minus: a3 | at_least: 0
  assign gray = section.settings.bg_grayscale | default: 12
  assign focal = section.settings.bg_position | default: 'center'
  assign preset = section.settings.bg_asset | default: 'hero-lifestyle-1.webp'
-%}

<div class="lbh-bg" aria-hidden="true">
  {%- if section.settings.bg_image != blank -%}
    <img src="{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2200 }}"
         srcset="{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w,
                 {{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w,
                 {{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
         sizes="100vw"
         width="{{ section.settings.bg_image.width }}"
         height="{{ section.settings.bg_image.height }}"
         alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  {%- else -%}
    <img src="{{ preset | asset_url }}"
         width="1264" height="848"
         alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
<div class="lbh-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
.lbh-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;overflow:hidden}
.lbh-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:{{ focal }};display:block;
  filter:grayscale({{ gray }}%) contrast(1.04) saturate(1.05)}

/* Centre stop is LOCKED at .92 — it is the headline's contrast floor and must
   not follow the visibility setting. Only the outer stops open up. */
.lbh-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 58% 54% at 50% 44%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a0 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 0%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a1 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 36%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a2 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 68%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a3 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.30) 0%, rgba(241,238,231,.46) 100%);
}
.lbh--ink .lbh-scrim{
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 58% 54% at 50% 44%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a0 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 0%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a1 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 36%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a2 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 68%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a3 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,7,10,.34) 0%, rgba(8,7,10,.56) 100%);
}
.lbh--ink .lbh-bg img{filter:grayscale({{ gray }}%) contrast(1.06) brightness(.8)}

/* particles ride above the scrim, copy above everything */
.lbh .lbh-fx{z-index:2}
.lbh .lbh-wrap,.lbh .lbh-cue{z-index:3}

@media(max-width:767px){
  /* a phone crop of a wide flat-lay is mostly surface — bias toward the goods */
  .lbh-bg img{object-position:center 34%}
  /* the copy is left-aligned on mobile, so move the protected zone with it */
  .lbh-scrim{background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 86% 52% at 30% 40%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a0 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 0%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a1 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 42%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a2 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 76%,
      rgba(252,251,248,{{ a3 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.34) 0%, rgba(241,238,231,.50) 100%)}
  .lbh--ink .lbh-scrim{background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 86% 52% at 30% 40%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a0 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 0%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a1 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 42%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a2 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 76%,
      rgba(8,7,10,{{ a3 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,7,10,.38) 0%, rgba(8,7,10,.60) 100%)}
}
</style>
